{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Negotiating Software License "}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.3"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when negotiating software license agreements."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Understand information about people's backgrounds in spoken or written documents.   Participate in the improvement of IT contracts, establishing technical clauses that respond to the needs of the negotiating agents, based on current laws on contracting."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of a range of grammar and vocabulary, and with the appropriate level of formality and purpose, coherence and cohesion for the context.  Recognizes simple ideas on concepts on IT contracts and knowledge transfer, simulated processes of IT contracting, and technological negotiation."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Verb + ing and to + Verb in Affirmative Statements"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<p>Some verbs are followed specifically by <strong>-ing </strong>or <strong>infinitive forms</strong> of the verbs.</p>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "A software license negotiation implies establishing an association between the licensor and the licensee to allow the customer to use the vendor's software."}, {"type": "example", "content": "This expert can assist to settle the best licensing terms by identifying intellectual property when applied."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Finally, try to go in pursuit of the control of the negotiation, and consider mandating the general rules for discussions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Below, you can find some common verbs that are followed by <strong>\u2013ing</strong> forms:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\u00b7         Avoid</br> \u00b7         Consider</br> \u00b7         Imply</br> \u00b7         Admit \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"-ing\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example: </br> <span class=\"italic\">A contract negotiation implies acknowledging both parts are looking for an advantage. </span> </br></br>  The following is a list of common verbs that are followed by the  <strong>infinite form </strong>of the verb:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\u00b7         Decide</br> \u00b7         Try</br> \u00b7         Assist</br> \u00b7         Determine</br> \u00b7         Want\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to verb\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example: </br>  <span class=\"italic\">An attorney with experience in licensing terms <span class=\"strong\">tries to settle </span> the best deal for the company. </span>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Other Tips for Negotiating Software License Agreements"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When negotiating software license agreements, you can follow these other recommendations for a successful agreement:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Make a list of non-negotiable terms: </span> </br> It will be useful to establish a list of terms that are non-negotiable. Although it would be made to look for a level of consistency, this list is intended to be flexible and will need to be updated as the negotiation process moves on. </br></br>  <span class=\"strong\">Contingency plan: </span></br> Both parties need to consider including terms that deal with possible future negative scenarios. </br></br>  <span class=\"strong\">Intellectual property: </span> </br> Conduct due diligence confirming the information regarding intellectual property provided by the vendor. It is necessary to confirm that the intellectual property is owned, and that it would not be subject to third-party claims."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "licensor"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the party in a negotiation process that grants a license"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: A software license negotiation implies establishing an association between the licensor and the licensee to allow the customer to use the vendor's software."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob05aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "appointed "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "selected to do a specific job"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You must make sure that the roles are clearly appointed to each participant before negotiations start."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob05aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "prior "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "before"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Negotiators might want to consider some strategies and tips, not only prior signing the contract, but also at the moment of future revisions or contract renewal."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob05aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "renewal"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the extension that is made to an agreement"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Negotiators might want to consider some strategies and tips, not only prior signing the contract, but also at the moment of future revisions or contract renewal."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob05aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "asset "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something valuable that gives an advantage"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Not only is an IT expert an important asset, but also an attorney with experience in licensing terms would be of a great help."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob05aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bargaining"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a discussion between parties involved in a negotiation in order to reach to an agreement"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This process of interaction, however, might depend on the specific personalities of the negotiators, and how flexible the bargaining position of each party is."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob05aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Search information about the requirements to negotiate software license agreements."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write ideas that you consider are relevant to define the requirements to negotiate software license agreements."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a summary including the main ideas about the requirements to negotiate software license agreements."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Proofread your summary before hand in it. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Have a classmate to read your summary."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Taking into account your classmate's remarks correct your summary. "}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I search information about the requirements to negotiate software license agreements. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write some relevant ideas related to the requirements to negotiate software license agreements. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a summary including the main ideas about requirements to negotiate software license agreements. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I proofread my text before hand in it. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I have a classmate to read my summary"}, {"type": "text", "content": "I take into account my classmate's remarks to improve my summary"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome"}, {"_data": [], "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n7le01ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "100", "image": "enpe8n7le01ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<p>A software license negotiation implies establishing an association between the licensor and the licensee to allow the customer to use the vendor&rsquo;s software. It is a complex process that requires both parties to make evident planning, communication, organization, patience, compromise, and flexibility.</p>\n<p>Negotiators might want to consider some strategies and tips, not only prior signing the contract, but also at the moment of future revisions or contract renewal. First, you cannot forget the specific needs of the end-users. It is critical that you have in mind the original business goal throughout the negotiation. Some critical terms such as maintenance and support, permissions to source code, and the description of authorized users might be critical to the company.</p>"}, {"time": "48000", "image": "enpe8n7le01ob05re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<p>Second, let the experts get involved in the negotiation. Not only an IT expert is an important asset, but also an attorney with experience in licensing terms would be of a great help. This expert can assist to settle the best licensing terms by identifying intellectual property when applied.</p>"}, {"time": "66000", "image": "enpe8n7le01ob05re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<p>Third, don&rsquo;t avoid establishing the roles played by the people involved. No matter whether the voice of your company is an attorney or an IT expert, you must make sure that the roles are clearly appointed to each participant before negotiations start.</p>\n<p>Finally, try to go in pursuit of the control of the negotiation, and consider mandating the general rules for discussions. However, it is also advisable to admit acknowledging the bargaining position of both parties. This process of interaction, however, might depend on the specific personalities of the negotiators, and how flexible the bargaining position of each party is.</p>"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n7le01ob05re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about the requirements to negotiate software license agreements."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can list some strategies and tips to negotiate software license agreements."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can discuss characteristics for strategies and tips to negotiate software license agreements."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What strategies or tips can you think of to successfully negotiate software license agreements? "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Is negotiating an initial license agreement as important as negotiating a contract renewal?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "